{"kind": "web_lines", "number": 1, "end_line": 13, "text": "对《郑州日报》问题的批示（一九六七年二月）\n中文马克思主义文库\n->\n毛泽东\n->\n1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》\n260)\n对《郑州日报》问题的批示\n（一九六七年二月）\n准备查封军管，时机宜迟几天，让骂解放军的多骂几天，然后左、右两派各派数人来谈。（四月六日周总理传达）\n上一页\n目录\n下一页\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-1929fa28d660bcea4faf", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-260.htm", "source_raw_sha256": "00462e289627210dc0cde86baab7aa0ae2782e38778d4d358ce7ef097ecdba70", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-1968", "volume": 5, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "c167e206151391467c84dec24e8ef92d14fb73bfdc5dec8c66766bb7dca5de7a", "text_chars": 149}
